window.SLI_TRANSLATIONS_ID.set("Battery supply chains require evidence of precursor, cathode and cell manufacturing—not just nickel extraction.","Rantai pasok baterai memerlukan bukti produksi prekursor, katoda, dan sel, bukan hanya penambangan nikel.");
